[
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "ccd4b8684fb357a743043891373cb89ae05b38c3e7a9948b1d10bdc138c2748e",
    "target": "实在无颜面对您……温贝特。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "5b8fcc9fbe99f34e55b5ecb6b0f97d9e1a49cae8249328b0088d100a64d3cb3a",
    "target": "……为了掌握皇女的行踪，派了那么多密探，结果就是这样？即使卡林兹看穿幻影阵，在那之前，你也曾与皇帝单独相处，却错过了机会。你的自负和从容，坏了大事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "64c2072724aa1c2e861d941ebface654e9e1dc505e149d3900f36282b84ef38d",
    "target": "即使卡林兹看穿幻影阵，在那之前，你也曾与皇帝单独相处，却错过了机会。你的自负和从容，坏了大事。我已经那样提醒，不管施瓦茨第七组多么没用，也不能小看卡林兹，你却还是犯了这种错。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "4c37050bd96331269ca9c0417a871286c8108086341db5a1f689153edb9eb692",
    "target": "我已经那样提醒，不管施瓦茨第七组多么没用，也不能小看卡林兹，你却还是犯了这种错。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "a44eb69937a19b0923b8894beb3c608a48d6a259ac360bef0733561a74a3a4a6",
    "target": "可是，温贝特……施瓦茨·施图尔姆，不是好对付的人。以前也有同伴试图刺杀皇帝，却全都未遂，被判处死刑。说实话，想到一直以来的牺牲……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "1dbbd36a02cb840d9cb59e7395f1291e31efb106d4ce0ed22aa99c1cd11e0c36",
    "target": "说实话，想到一直以来的牺牲……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "58a33f3e1da465190557805d0c518a36d0f8b178f82825180e3270cd57ce8f51",
    "target": "梅菲斯托，做不可能的事，总伴随着牺牲。若逐一顾虑，就办不成大事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "56d1c96d02778a91b2716e0ee641bd0dff92a6be68ca9cb59a2805891a64d290",
    "target": "萝洁，或许，我太信任你了。让经验不足的你，执行这么重要的事，是我的失误吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "37a6313d66e555d3458f9c8bb557428ad9356a3618fdf9bdc3f08c5712c41d95",
    "target": "不是。下次……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "6912fc2c3fe5d405b83a6be89d0020752dc61f316ba5307d4e23e9aa68c594f2",
    "target": "温贝特为什么突然回来……十多年杳无音讯……我们也一直以为，他已经死了。究竟发生了什么，让他如此仇恨皇室？重建克罗伊斯，似乎完全不在他心里……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "72d1abd3bdbb5de06c1d09eebd717f378f77e3a87ecc138f08d7abbb400d27b7",
    "target": "究竟发生了什么，让他如此仇恨皇室？重建克罗伊斯，似乎完全不在他心里……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "3f1bcff742a33efb1e45afc6b737a597c6a6b37f8d0455082107be51f55455fc",
    "target": "对不起……梅菲斯托。竟让温贝特制定的计划，全部落空。明明有机会杀死皇帝……我太大意了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "7e1fa2a7fb9a848ba76c2440f95f98bf068cb203b134d063d7bfce228a241947",
    "target": "只是经验还不足。本来，我也可以出手，但温贝特指定你，说明对你寄予厚望。不要让他失望。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "295ff5322adf2274d6dd32c2d634427e245c0be5b2877dda679a4122d6781ba5",
    "target": "本来，我也可以出手，但温贝特指定你，说明对你寄予厚望。不要让他失望。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "dfe794681a87946bfec6c8d850dd2438908905a3a3c94d5e57da0beab7d268eb",
    "target": "我知道……是他从贫民窟捡回我，将我养大。可是……总觉得，他变了很多。从前虽然严厉，也有温柔的一面。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "fbb08c171c99f5187897936aeebc653d7e3ac1a243d64257aa9c1be625db5bc6",
    "target": "总觉得，他变了很多。从前虽然严厉，也有温柔的一面。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:17:17",
    "source_sha256": "bb5a896547bb3f38521325ecd9a15fddbe38cab69dfc7fdacdd849a63fc3c9d7",
    "target": "失踪十年，一定经历了许多事。性格有所改变，也不奇怪。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:18:18",
    "source_sha256": "83f605fbe0743ec9a223c7d86422eb493dbf98fc5af059c2c1dd3faf2752b839",
    "target": "可我还是……有些迷茫。当然，我很清楚，他在贝尔米利昂，是绝对的存在……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:19:19",
    "source_sha256": "38c81dd2d50bea0dca8c68be4e6e6ab187c8173ad478e430f98bde28e67af96b",
    "target": "无法否认萝洁的话。因为，我也……一样……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0456.fpb:text:20:20",
    "source_sha256": "21e176865f20843461393dbc7a76bbdbc48774b00241d8c4df09934cfbf5a5b0",
    "target": "卡林兹虽麻烦，也会好好留在施瓦茨吧。那么，该寻找替我造就神器的人了。尽量安排有能力的家伙，希望，他们能收集出色的卡尔塔。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "c576ab53e7d638676ab402854bf30b1916f819f14ffc0ecee41d9fbb1755aae4",
    "target": "迟了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "81ac1b795ea514e5bd6ffb7f369ebabf0888d131879cca38f2b2cd734722b8f6",
    "target": "啊，抱歉。皇宫警卫太严……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "268b4201f4f1be0de4d64c220e7c1e6695952f5d23ac951d244a63bbdab2f58c",
    "target": "情况怎么样？艾丝特尔做得好吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "e88d16455b531f3d20d66e44efb2cfffb58235afa0b41265f83609e7b90cf735",
    "target": "皇帝已经完全迷上艾丝特尔，连皇后也不放在眼里。现在，皇宫中支持艾丝特尔的威尔莱特，与支持蕾欧娜的吉尔伯特，正势均力敌地对峙。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "140414c435fe4cac1d2d3938cc65908277e239924cc2cc734d7caaf9c6047e98",
    "target": "现在，皇宫中支持艾丝特尔的威尔莱特，与支持蕾欧娜的吉尔伯特，正势均力敌地对峙。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "436763883bfe6bd92862e797dcc21720b9d6903917740ab3fe3e605700615ccf",
    "target": "威尔莱特……那家伙，知道艾丝特尔是什么人吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "9c44b59df46aa482ebc3838df2a3145491de090502b312951e7cac5838fd5609",
    "target": "她以马拉卡特贵族的假身份出现，他似乎信以为真。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "897ad440ddf656fa409948eb3f07dfaefb625bd635f16cf53267acd1c157a942",
    "target": "总之，艾丝特尔做得很好。没人会想到，她是贝尔米利昂的间谍。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0457.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "3b5c793740d3edaab4547ec885f5f5302012c8e477578f34d905e055223e97d3",
    "target": "帝国历1005年",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "9e93ef1b5a5222f4e3e9722ab093ba35f90ce3a599132d70371138c7109f9d89",
    "target": "菲莉西亚，再坚持一下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "fa585718c6393e64919b430de6faf767b654aaeef8e3fe503665edec1bbf5be2",
    "target": "你骗了我。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "7d87bc1863a5e303af4c4202e27d9cfd6936378008ebb8633a4d9c151496ee91",
    "target": "相信我的你，才是傻瓜。我早就和你们这群，欺压无辜平民、嚷嚷着毁灭皇室的人，断绝关系了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "fd7f0fd731e1e56bc2d563bcf6e90fa6e2ea8ad83cbf21e0b498ebb76848d43b",
    "target": "是吗？那就逃逃看吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "51657f5bd95360ae6e56a96bf0f12c9514bbd1630241b9f12912a94996200494",
    "target": "站在那里堵住出口，就有用吗？你以为，我连你也打不过？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "a019c235c7b855c0f4212c1d849e3fe502c6586e91089ab3586e2c9692e3aed7",
    "target": "说什么呢。你没想过，我放心丢下菲莉西亚，是有原因的？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "6ecf2efb5957fa179108b76d06d6862c9de959e1c1c2bbeb7050b47fd920b160",
    "target": "……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "5f395f35beaa7f6ae88fe68f9aec6c13e48a12e83f7ece5d001c3b6d9e11cd9e",
    "target": "菲莉西亚，过来。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "ae025f856613ab56fe8bb5921d1b607e38ce1ee13d7d9d037bf27dd207c28faf",
    "target": "菲莉西亚？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "26f8f019d13c2caa315808c72ab14448a02ebfc1bf1a04a09eee2ae909eed3d9",
    "target": "没用的。不知道吧？所有灵印士，都被洗脑，要优先服从贝尔米利昂的命令。你敢乱来试试。我现在，就能命令菲莉西亚自杀。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "404513368bc1a95815c2d21677b293883fa0d26609275881f9ecee0f11764570",
    "target": "你真敢这么做？杀死菲莉西亚，梅菲斯托不会放过你。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "73d675dd6344d49b3a36ed044f59410d36895f9f0ffbd6d630344e02ae62992b",
    "target": "没错。只要你老实待着，自然不会发生。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "7c5e563c1e1cce1ca9cb69a8796e02144397029ede4ae7ff6a05d22d6f01b720",
    "target": "听懂了吗？哪怕动一根手指……菲莉西亚，也可能立即送命。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "e3c0be3f658e761e0e6d79ef364ce4cfbc0d9272baaba9310c9a2ce7bebcd01e",
    "target": "菲莉西亚……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "c2f1481a175568f7285a07e6904388950981eafb9b99fd9ae6b9e5f142ebc38d",
    "target": "菲莉西亚，杀死乔克。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:17:17",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:18:18",
    "source_sha256": "7a4c9fd82239c317808280a803a329e4bb110645c7f6b61476a3c29be92f215a",
    "target": "犹豫什么？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:19:19",
    "source_sha256": "460608474769917113343edbf81385fba65b3e3aec35bdb019ba24317a700a20",
    "target": "啊……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:20:20",
    "source_sha256": "3cc2f0b7b3a294a7a4d95761604a249b8f991a20b0821ee794681e5bf6ee3bad",
    "target": "呃……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:21:21",
    "source_sha256": "e013e76608e4a3388f2620034116fd80d464a65f1cbf22adab32106e75065087",
    "target": "很好。对，菲莉西亚，杀死乔克。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:22:22",
    "source_sha256": "059954059e5110bd3368acd0e6430e5c7843872111f2a5e22100aa7921be1c06",
    "target": "快！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:23:23",
    "source_sha256": "dc18bb9e713ea2242acda9209319b03fef6c93f52b74fd90955b2efa01be235f",
    "target": "……身体，不听使唤吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:24:24",
    "source_sha256": "dd80462a1aad8014e563fccdf7f22eef9b43e39fb76741dcc5eaa958a3113196",
    "target": "到此为止。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:25:25",
    "source_sha256": "6ecf2efb5957fa179108b76d06d6862c9de959e1c1c2bbeb7050b47fd920b160",
    "target": "……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:26:26",
    "source_sha256": "c50b67cedbbc5c14e3a31fed17462a2735948e52993465cac6ecc7fc29da822f",
    "target": "最好，收回那个命令。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:27:27",
    "source_sha256": "fbaa8415cd15fedfdcf2a8ce4a90d8e8e4371d93bb9f7ae0c09131fdb523f585",
    "target": "你，什么时候……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:28:28",
    "source_sha256": "dcf6fd488fe972f78ca79f9f40741edbfb31d03529a32a27097d72bd97647545",
    "target": "我说，收回命令。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:29:29",
    "source_sha256": "62be32274b7c2b874c53d9eb2a5f53d6896dfbfc0b0b48f826361f6b79586714",
    "target": "啧……菲、菲莉西亚，停下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:30:30",
    "source_sha256": "2f39b10dc8559ded440d5ca97b8a33321e76cb1d78edcee8366a41c17daed420",
    "target": "……菲莉西亚。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:31:31",
    "source_sha256": "64df0f30e8f342e4e2f5d38d2e5f4a8d49918390df41707d5e32aa81da54154c",
    "target": "组长，你没事啊！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:32:32",
    "source_sha256": "578009c775e02ac70f7bf7ec9bc57085a16add2b449d63c0690e35cb03510811",
    "target": "真是的，不是说过，不会死吗。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:33:33",
    "source_sha256": "c129e57ba0bbe23547fbe2457f4d6cfa781f888177572522969dde0bdc75fa21",
    "target": "……连那些家伙也来了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:34:34",
    "source_sha256": "37729a673c385e7cbebfac9ac6b1a947c1c21e2231b286a151e570b8f9dcbf1b",
    "target": "你早就中计了。如今，明白我为什么说你愚蠢了吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:35:35",
    "source_sha256": "56003689977bdd7187df7610be1b7fcc6a700e91e25c3d028065b1dc26c80bfe",
    "target": "和乔克联手的，是你们……打算把我怎么样？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:36:36",
    "source_sha256": "03909f5ab0123a8fcc99e0fc3a6fe8b3cabb84a62550013ba9333c84db3965d5",
    "target": "命令菲莉西亚，今后不用再听你的命令。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:37:37",
    "source_sha256": "c11cbe866c33f02f42a48af84d0d456145c06c5c16aaf4c77fb806f328b903db",
    "target": "什么？谁会听你的……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:38:38",
    "source_sha256": "8c185bc190631be556ea9c628802718419a4ef4799886ee12ff7de5ae4a4d33f",
    "target": "尽可能，不想用这把剑。我也不想轻易攻击女人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:39:39",
    "source_sha256": "3d80f4d6081941d54304ca7620aaff3935d0dfa72c8a1df3048e21e1e669671c",
    "target": "……菲莉西亚……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:40:40",
    "source_sha256": "0f456ce1fe71fa851e9adde9134c1bd2d6546596fa94f5f48606aba2af2a2817",
    "target": "对卡林兹施行灵印！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:41:41",
    "source_sha256": "6ecf2efb5957fa179108b76d06d6862c9de959e1c1c2bbeb7050b47fd920b160",
    "target": "……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:42:42",
    "source_sha256": "2461d699fa23b5f3ebfdbc9bbd385ceb77e03b618d3fb9d6dd38d59c0d9bdbf2",
    "target": "什、什么，这是……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:43:43",
    "source_sha256": "b0a32c18793dc58c07b603ffb07f799089fadb85d20689e9d410d8eaa9dcc7dd",
    "target": "哈、哈哈……你以为，我会把重要的希安，原样交给你？你也太信任以前的朋友了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:44:44",
    "source_sha256": "d8b4a0507aae89cff2442723ecef74045dd5e2de52f4a7757848d47e27ad813c",
    "target": "乔克……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:45:45",
    "source_sha256": "00ea303b2b6f8c7263b4dd83826f21ede1f2c661c607d69fb10196f23a0b1a68",
    "target": "我应该提醒过，别相信那家伙。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:46:46",
    "source_sha256": "9726cd443da955db3c211c0856d3089287f80831ed7768bee781ec692c1e8e14",
    "target": "……梅菲斯托！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:47:47",
    "source_sha256": "992dc197ad694d8c2214a7efc666ddc8ee1d5ff4eb003e48efad5be05043c1e1",
    "target": "我只是，为了贝尔米利昂……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:48:48",
    "source_sha256": "f2a372b6be342069f4910c439d380faaa8481240354c7bf2bb3f55b1b4f4d59e",
    "target": "所以，仅仅因为自己压过了乔克，就得意忘形？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:49:49",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:50:50",
    "source_sha256": "80bcc0cdedd8e9ae06141e77f6ccfcda854b2919629cfafaf9bd643bf40b58f9",
    "target": "好久不见。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0458.fpb:text:51:51",
    "source_sha256": "3a2029f94dc0ef22524e29367ed3c37596c301bc0050418110bdab74ada1a9eb",
    "target": "我没有心思，和你说没用的话。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0459.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "b19d85f8e40a3644ce8bec69f88acd923b80b1d9285b9f352951f671a8dab836",
    "target": "想夹着尾巴逃跑？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0459.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "efbc5fb4422abf1e06ba178cf503713093d5a875cad8803be411d9788c632a08",
    "target": "你就是卡林兹？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0459.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "50ddd54c94518318a0455e0d44a4465925442ce442418bc9f4f87e7d1ae425b8",
    "target": "是又如何？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0459.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "ed0124c09b21764b92dbf0bf6783f54b4ccac9710b1d6bcff4f823b31d032a03",
    "target": "……很快，还会见面。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0460.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "d199bacb9e40a292d4b23697434dcc59bb6804058555852231e3e3db3a2f6af4",
    "target": "实力，还是那么可怕。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0460.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "92f5aee1deab1338359e15c210ecbf8378a07e68dcc6f8cb579b11c049e7a29b",
    "target": "梅菲斯托费勒斯，还是第一次亲眼见到。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0460.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "047d089956ab3b567d9116db4e63055084785b31167c9f22d835d80d7fa16dbe",
    "target": "那就是贝尔米利昂的领袖？名不虚传。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0460.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "3a3d521234aa80aa8641dc32355933ecd4a7968496f88096b3184a3cf6e6a556",
    "target": "费尔南那家伙，也变了很多。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "01cfe889ab2de737c6438da77bc1427bc8bfa8be65733c9d774e82f275a03dd2",
    "target": "什么……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "4c89b20c5031df30ee5d561b2750b63c797a153746cd14366084e6c55ad5233f",
    "target": "你认识……温贝特？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "4601f80e78870731910a21321cc5a2c818426567b4679bb6e27a556b79758db7",
    "target": "可以说，他才是贝尔米利昂真正的领袖。可怕的家伙，剑术超乎想象。左臂特别长，挥舞着巨大的剑。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "eda3fadfaf7d80c6c329f07209d6c5ba7cfa488f78c55e8f563e4ee04012fffc",
    "target": "怎么会……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "b473a242984d15d7626224263af89e0108a191388e75e7d148f7e8cf9f839bf1",
    "target": "一瞬间，脑中仿佛一片空白。那家伙……竟是贝尔米利昂的领袖。那么，艾丝特尔的死……也和他有关吗？许多疑问，突然涌现。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "5be9e0f15809917349368d3c45e4e9457f8cae9d96dbd746d50d5795795675e7",
    "target": "不过……把菲莉西亚交给施瓦茨，是什么意思？我们也许会除掉她。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "7996bed07d522211d1070e0d535f036facfb7c6998c1d0d9a1f0d9431b653aa1",
    "target": "不会吧。她肯定是出色的战力。她很强，一定能做好。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "6860d072d2e1a9063e1bc3e518313ec25bd04f9b0cd446eeaca857028c0b47a0",
    "target": "……很珍惜她啊。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "c8e39e8eda6e46a29d6c3da1b87f48935d59433d6b8427ceb390215f410270ce",
    "target": "对我来说，她值得如此。自从她失踪，我一直在找，没想到，竟成为灵印士……真令人难以置信。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:10:17",
    "source_sha256": "efaf81b87edce80c3c916665da415771bbcd69c771d357a76cc0a1b39283c82a",
    "target": "我曾想，即使勉强，也要让菲莉西亚加入斯卡拉姆修。但贝尔米利昂，肯定会想夺回她……最终，不会放过斯卡拉姆修。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:11:16",
    "source_sha256": "c6388b82e8f07eaedcd4c1d9865e7a15bce679a19f4fdaa5863820f5cdcdfbb7",
    "target": "如今的斯卡拉姆修，若与贝尔米利昂交战，会惨败。虽然，现在也已经在走向毁灭……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:12:15",
    "source_sha256": "5e30f7b1e53d6844522219201e038bf124aadf9e993cb286348101464af55e3f",
    "target": "即使如此，我也不能为了自己的目的，让斯卡拉姆修那样崩溃。但更不能，让菲莉西亚一直当灵印士。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:13:10",
    "source_sha256": "5351717cab29cf23ecb26633df468e6896fa7ba36b882642a681988f0cc22f9e",
    "target": "因为……灵印士，死得早？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:14:11",
    "source_sha256": "f2fd57ccb53c5dfa189102c3637a991a72f7cd90c45b3c48d6f989d8a7cc0513",
    "target": "每次灵印，消耗的不是体力，而是灵魂。很可怕吧。明知道，寿命不断缩短……可眼前看不见，也就不知道，自己受了多么致命的伤。$n最后，我认为，能保护菲莉西亚、不受贝尔米利昂伤害的地方，只有施瓦茨·施图尔姆。虽然，这也是勉强的办法。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:15:12",
    "source_sha256": "63dd593048377c1e3225dbe34ee0f846adff11d5328b94d5ec0ffc79c9415997",
    "target": "……菲莉西亚暂且不说，你今后怎么办？既然已经被施瓦茨抓住，即使事情顺利结束，我们也不能释放你。除非，你自己逃走。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:16:13",
    "source_sha256": "e023fe83c9a69c39bc81ffb96a07d2734c1b617beb190405c13678199742dfb4",
    "target": "是啊，确实……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0461.fpb:text:17:14",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "7441aac537881399ca5aac34b2e0365fbc8f651573e88750b9a9c7ed2bea3d14",
    "target": "菲莉西亚……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "1ef54857f6a1e17a64cc72d453845bcecd643cacd97970eb441e72e8c7d06f5b",
    "target": "以你的实力，不会有事。你很强……但今后，不要再进行灵印了。我希望，你能长久活下去。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "d97567017ad9b28ba91f770c3973024309f1c444bed7fc073f0417102c5adf36",
    "target": "保重。抱歉，我不能丢下那些家伙。他们因为我，才落到那种地步，我必须帮他们。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "abc62f063601c6b2f88034b4f97eec94d408d908d6a89852eb591889e1d3e27b",
    "target": "果然，不记得我，真好……也许再也见不到了，没关系吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0462.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "86c12745245b9fc44048291f382bce74a587fd0f835153858b1649b90a8c278e",
    "target": "嗯，好好生活。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "26102a20ab9e83f10fb091ec85a56bb5f21a6d782d0ac9ad74afd60d4f797d3e",
    "target": "……我没能保护她。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "5d9f3b1b3db816d93c49ca018875c7be5ff121a75de41f5501edd69f204baf53",
    "target": "明明亲眼看着，却没能保护她。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "f5b6bdc6c8fe5f07c8c2f815b2ff7180adf542de888eee7a51dcc233d171d496",
    "target": "总觉得……她还会突然出现，就像艾丝特尔。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "6435f2cef63dc6c754dbffe29d669b0eae1eb63f8bcd09d10de81b5bcf434e5b",
    "target": "哎呀，男孩子竟然戴手镯。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "bc6067bef4f6139b7c6a050df5e889711438d989b6e6107110241ccae1641f90",
    "target": "不是。这是母亲的遗物。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "fae31493408a6799bb311a6a3d65ccfa6a1022cb4cd2a3f0e0c35eabcd6089ce",
    "target": "啊……对不起，我不知道。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "5b548bee6abe6ed4b3014368325014f0dd312e2d248ff421a1cdff42b2ae79ea",
    "target": "母亲，去世了？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "38cb64fca3623c8e408d537722e72c39fffca237f6e2dbf4270d0da65ab32c58",
    "target": "听说……生我时死了。父亲说的。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "118df94b72749816fb4a98274cde17eb0d348e754ca28adba0ee28dba974bbc4",
    "target": "这样啊。连母亲的脸，也不知道吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "9958ad4bf67ca8cce14c646ab602878f66eeea174dadf6e777d54984a09e7a44",
    "target": "……怎么可能知道。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "e9eaf7d1674b5080546b4e63d2a21c344a57a3b511accdd9e789755e1694e9d7",
    "target": "啊，抱歉。总说些奇怪的话。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "7cf1ee921791c10ee2de514f9d7df56ffbef07cd511cbf17fae77735fb35f3a4",
    "target": "父亲从不提母亲。他们的关系，似乎不好。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0463.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "836d9b87595c67885a89efc208aac7701eb64e10f11c1d81f4bc733053b68527",
    "target": "容纳卡尔塔的器皿，希安……至今，我们一直只会从古代遗迹中寻找，无法自己制造。因为，还未找到把卡尔塔刻入武器或工具的方法。若能亲手制造，确实是了不起的事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "91e0e04a76263064b2bcd4b201b4dec995e8996c927ad5811779442001715a86",
    "target": "若能亲手制造，确实是了不起的发现。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "2d127dd21888cfe3bb79a9cbc3ac33872b816f6a4ff1823817162954edb60372",
    "target": "想模仿古老传说？勇者的武器，会成为神圣的希安……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "91dfacc893140b3f5e14910b67a8290ca29ef51659e5199a9da2f9457c36cbe7",
    "target": "那并非毫无根据的胡话。将卡尔塔刻入武器，它的能力就会改变。虽然，组合不当，也会变成废铁，但也可能，成为拥有新力量的希安。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "d5ed5db03f0a1a8e51a04d289b2f391e37874b9a5301b3167a44be3cc44663fd",
    "target": "虽然，组合不当，也会变成废铁，但也可能，成为拥有新力量的希安。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "2d6444f11f879934461e1eb49066646f3c5ff937d7aaa0cefe29daeaedba6e30",
    "target": "没说得那么容易吧。强大的卡尔塔难以获得，也没找到，完美刻入的方法。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "45d11e6a8f1c9cde82699ed9b403f37b44fc2f507afc916984725d13b3898506",
    "target": "虽仍在研究，总有一天，会找到真相。获得强大的希安，能为我们增加重要战力。妖石与灵印士，也正在研究，很快就会取得成果。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "eba6f4c3afde11ae626c294bfc19e5a1b037dea4e8fb2f63acf8a6555643da49",
    "target": "妖石与灵印士，也正在研究，很快就会取得成果。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "28f1327db59e3e819be1c45932e987aaad79f29427436f8247c330c13b117fdc",
    "target": "……也是。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "7a91d5d2d2fb79f07617d30c9621bd5e7c7370e05eb1a03217c0a19a8a6334c3",
    "target": "不过，你的脸憔悴了不少。儿子，还好吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "06fe68ffc8ee71a5d97589f187b958355f693862bef16db777fb56ead648ef3d",
    "target": "……本来就没有母亲，似乎很寂寞，我也不怎么顾得上他。可怜的孩子，生在这种时代。若是从前，就能在所有人簇拥的王宫里长大。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "72c66515167091909f86e8d16efbc277d4f247bde1c97c95494cbb92faf8b36f",
    "target": "生在这种时代。若是从前，就能在所有人簇拥的王宫里长大。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0464.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0466.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "6b86b273ff34fce19d6b804eff5a3f5747ada4eaa22f1d49c01e52ddb7875b4b",
    "target": null,
    "state": "preserved",
    "preservation_evidence": "仅含数字的源测试字段；用途未确认，保留字节且不计为翻译。"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0472.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "f6b2e4ba02f196011e7f607dee4caabd939854f241f07b57518835965eb29585",
    "target": "你这个笨丫头。tㅡ.ㅡt",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0472.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "59c8b2a01b72314e2498b764891bd90306d89a904a9be9716ea65c28505a27d3",
    "target": "像你这样的笨丫头，去死吧～ㅡ.ㅡㅗ",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0472.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "ab5df625bc76dbd4e163bed2dd888df828f90159bb93556525c31821b6541d46",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0473.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "2ac66abc0900bdcba4ed6beec1c2cecaaad3000834a9fe703ab575ebff8cfb3b",
    "target": "安静得让人不舒服。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0473.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "8f7b709111ae4f094131e9957f0f0ceae93de839a4457d9abfbe73662e5f2ce8",
    "target": "平民应该撤离了，收拾剩下的家伙吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0473.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "ecb05a567553457d90c86ada479a892e580b88226201b7583403524c0df1829f",
    "target": "别命令我。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0473.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "c796e5de6334515914976c587b4890018f7c9796933049d751756d136badd6d1",
    "target": "只是建议。脾气真差。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0475.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "d7b3ec8d3a6c6d368d9c25dfef178c8b4db0c8fd753a30dedffe51c341bb7beb",
    "target": "我要重生。抹去这悲惨的过去，连同自己本身……以全新的我，重新诞生。$n在这古代的希安上赌上一切，以我的过去作抵押……从这一刻起，成为一直梦想的全新自我，重生成所有人憧憬的完美之人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0475.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "3130edb5e60ad6bb34144f5d8648f4f81b74d8b7c192613ee3e8683bd6e82cc7",
    "target": "啊……！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0475.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "04fabd081c1b4565b5d00d57e6a8b96de13062a675c87a900cb6ff83f247d654",
    "target": "呼……又是那个该死的梦……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0475.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "17f114f14fbf7314baa4ab7c7f4482b2d914fd0dada8c8d62c452cfccbe80c03",
    "target": "快到了吗。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0475.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "63d02dc8a21a39adc8fe41e33919c9e148cdf582ac9f76a66e1dd0b801819bf2",
    "target": "从那不愿回想的残酷一天起，竟已过去十年。从没想过，回到这里，会需要如此漫长的时间。$n有着怀念的回忆，却承载着更多痛苦的土地……修德尔米尔。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0477.fpb:text:0:0",
