    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0489.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "5a577dc628b464a98d3092897b1efe4ee38be28512fd9ffe8cd837e8c37c9f77",
    "target": "利斯顿地区南部",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0489.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "fae7ad6775130332a1a9d83af4eab933783abddcef51af559ac81c6f032feda5",
    "target": "这里有些可疑，不过，之后再来看看吧……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0490.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "dad04bd2a37b577ee45323425ca1c5212479aa337e8f3059633f5fb89a355f1e",
    "target": "利斯顿地区东北部·火之洞窟附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "3b6454cf74b45ba6bf0f32352fb80c792d033e615d1d71742006d542a422ebf6",
    "target": "罗恩德里大道西部·修德尔米尔附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "3f81978337fac6ffdcbb92ef4418a424be2d3adb21d147618acc1ea97e974f4e",
    "target": "不要走得太远。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "a7c45aedb9327a9f62a63a53530785f3c317937e6a2886be439038b0ac8e6f33",
    "target": "唉……差点死了。罗恩德里大道虽美，却不是能放心游逛的安全地方。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "3ecb9b0c0b1e057becf3f2e1ce31d9d3e987989be9c817a948f3695269df4a79",
    "target": "刚才也险些被怪物干掉，幸好，一位叫Tian的人救了我。知道他吗？这附近，很有名的猎人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "023a425a274e6484afdec856b66e14276c16d2802a507d1b00ece47f7661be11",
    "target": "在狩猎大会上，也夺冠过多次……Tian每次出场，总能留下新故事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:5:7",
    "source_sha256": "6a3945cd0ac5b3199d17dd96890c83b67de8732e6bbfee51afe502bc8aed3695",
    "target": "你对道，有兴趣吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:6:8",
    "source_sha256": "65475377e24acbf4170c93246957b23eeedbaa3a2400fe26c4a3c9877f8aa231",
    "target": "初见就觉得，你的眼神不寻常。眼里蕴含神秘的天之气息。明白吗，是天之气息。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0498.fpb:text:7:9",
    "source_sha256": "5416c6e30e7745fc5fc1a3c1c11fd49c520bb6be064e5374fc4ea3442e9013df",
    "target": "我是灵验的道士Moo。你对道，有兴趣吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "4c1f5668575c4f30038dbf6f33b1407166cfb112b953ae5f5ae4aca445cd2591",
    "target": "罗恩德里大道北部",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "25382fc30b8fd091cc6f969d57aecddd3dde8808059794c3e1de9e1399c64585",
    "target": "爷爷到底去哪里了？说是采什么草药，却一直没消息。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "0848c41099f5ee165904036d368e0a861337c2fce75073d75168e4831bfab848",
    "target": "说什么，要高价卖给叫多利多利的商人。总之，只要能赚钱，就没有他不做的事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "b9a53cb51c5838ea43b3e025a5d07139a6e9726eb9ae63243c15929c7d81a28a",
    "target": "多利多利是修德尔米尔有名的商人。听说，不合心意的话，给再多的钱，也不卖东西。很奇怪吧？和普通商人，很不一样。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "eb9e68ae6c85bebf2f798f37e1bad1b1de8c81908a4cd451459a5f41aee24456",
    "target": "知道通心粉吗？那是最近从东方传来的特色菜。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "033d41a960a6421603d2188e83e34225dfbea590d400caa9eb0fd16525d2ed96",
    "target": "味道鲜美，价格也便宜，我们这些平民，也能轻松享用。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0499.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "369245f387c49eea17c0d362776b33277fac0e97b247b0a5ceca771f9580f723",
    "target": "你去酒馆或旅店时，也点一次通心粉吧。马上就会明白，我说的是真的。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0500.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "445a460cce9ed881c62d26ed29a21c70072a3dd077f684c618bc7be7fee6af7c",
    "target": "罗恩德里大道东部·水之遗迹附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0500.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "1fc9e9b105148123598f0afa122898b85222a5933a615aca68354f7680bfd2de",
    "target": "附近有水之遗迹。不过，不太稳定，有坍塌的危险，小心。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0500.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "353143fc8b8e6d6745ffdf3d907d21624612fcac89b6d691139e3b7508e984b5",
    "target": "古代人究竟为什么，要建造那些遗迹？虽很奇妙……我却不太喜欢。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0500.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "2651c949ea695784e4f5a97b768f8704b1a491ba32ac4580d99369c816a4d642",
    "target": "我来这里采草药，听说，什么伤口都能很快治好。拿到多利多利那个商人那里，能卖个好价钱。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "589d837b55ed634e23f5aace306e39708b5746b92597e135f70515d18b403b2e",
    "target": "罗恩德里大道中心·席哈拉平原附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:1:4",
    "source_sha256": "65f91466fbca78e08248d5b4a0ad0694e45efe89f8938902017172dbb1fad154",
    "target": "不要离修德尔米尔太远。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:2:5",
    "source_sha256": "e00d107fa0385f7456e335b7f292adc764a13c6e302e33f35c1b608d74d9ec84",
    "target": "听过ESTi吗？据说，是修德尔米尔最大的色鬼。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:3:6",
    "source_sha256": "8acc9bc5ae06f7866cc0c583e6e6c147e9e3894e4f10bc442cd74686a8f062de",
    "target": "听说，他建了自己的后宫。从某方面说，真让人羡慕。我这种人，想都不敢想。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:4:7",
    "source_sha256": "e48f00228b632ad0124328ae1cf933284ee395301c4f18de0c225671648fb730",
    "target": "可换个角度，又觉得可恨……啧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:5:8",
    "source_sha256": "d44642808b28ffec444787937746eab181df08390c674977958c28fe2a290041",
    "target": "这里风景优美，也很适合狩猎。皇帝陛下每年都举行狩猎大会。当日献上最漂亮狐皮的人，就是赢家。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:6:9",
    "source_sha256": "291b38d43cf35dfd699464254f5f764d017e2d0d787542d4c5f54c719dac409c",
    "target": "为此，我也正提前练习。狩猎不限平民或贵族，不然，你也试试？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0501.fpb:text:7:10",
    "source_sha256": "0e56f3ec5cdf71295a876301ae00ef9b2859c424cdc0534de4e02dce96ce0b42",
    "target": "嘿，这次要是弄到上好的狐皮，就能白得一笔钱，几年都不用干活。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0502.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "b6895b8e65b6c1433979eeb07b0cf909b3c00716152439bf1ac737cd0a6ebde6",
    "target": "罗韦尔森林·隆韦尔平原附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0503.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "3aa4f1710d7db8740cb7975003d26cb56507fecbfa951bdf899356294301e026",
    "target": "罗韦尔森林中部",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0503.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "1c47dc92e2a02a1f013c11bfa2f166c122fcf95d5d394c760089b826ebb08d1a",
    "target": "往这里走，就通往杰克林德森林。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0503.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "5b3c039a85578b5ccf18038705d3b78c7a3274d2dc58bc2a6aedf7993adc92df",
    "target": "这里是通往杰克林德森林、隆韦尔平原及修德尔米尔的三岔路。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0503.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "ec634ebe45b7d52b3bf7da47b47fdb7309dca736452e7f42324de0bcc17d1f5a",
    "target": "杰克林德森林另一边，就是利斯顿地区。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0504.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "86adfda40b405f4d00fb0632c60f9016c5cdbdfd248d5de248191eb31fbe493a",
    "target": "罗韦尔森林·杰克林德森林附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0505.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "d4af3c5b47813737a5640178ad78cc2efe6682834bc8665d88f8d79de911cb2c",
    "target": "罗韦尔森林南部",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0506.fpb:text:0:1",
    "source_sha256": "37ad837eca26de49dd789de67797559a96f9c1f4079497171030a99f4aed53d4",
    "target": "罗韦尔森林东南部",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0506.fpb:text:1:2",
    "source_sha256": "4e574c6860d7f052009781ace9a8bbf4a0c2d6a316161da615a34fcc3fdcd5e4",
    "target": "这里，不是去修德尔米尔的方向。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0507.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "0891f0660dcee9e47d0364b816ededeb65445e9eac19df3b0dd649628ace95e2",
    "target": "罗韦尔森林·修德尔米尔附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0507.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "03332ff6084b943f80041d9bf9acc999aa1f56c54350f59989bcfc3e764d6a0b",
    "target": "看起来，你会用剑。基本操作知道吗？进入战斗后，在可移动范围内，敌人进入射程时，就用空格键攻击。当然，要保证战斗画面右侧的TP槽，足够充足。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0507.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "a1f9cbc75fc6952dd96ec4fe3a9709032632270b05aab9bae00a6aa1a963a285",
    "target": "想进一步展示实力，就试试CTRL键，或鼠标右键。不过，TP不足，就不能再行动，要用D键或鼠标右键，调出菜单，结束回合。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0507.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "151e3344bf53a9b60613d854209d4d1af29744fa4500b3eff12b18a1bbd75d91",
    "target": "这是经历过无数风浪的老人的忠告，好好记住吧。那么……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0512.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "d8fc25b8ad4ff9f809cf6b290583dc9e22a5b2bd17582aab698e25e0b15260da",
    "target": "呼呃。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0512.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "16610afa68ac23b00fb942773a8c12b7db2ab08cdd7d286ca6f5bcd940b2d304",
    "target": "隆韦尔平原·罗韦尔森林附近",
    "state": "translated"
  },
